              {
                "id": "p17-q24-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Factor the difference of squares, then use ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta=1",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos^4\\theta-\\sin^4\\theta&=(\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)(\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta)\\\\\\cos^4\\theta-\\sin^4\\theta&=\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta\\\\\\cos^4\\theta-\\sin^4\\theta&=\\cos^2\\theta-(1-\\cos^2\\theta)\\\\\\cos^4\\theta-\\sin^4\\theta&=2\\cos^2\\theta-1\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta=1$, the final expression is the RHS.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
